                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "232476875",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199569412560",
                            "num_reviews": 4,
                            "playtime_forever": 259,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 129,
                            "last_played": 1786410335
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I cannot be sure if this game is worth $10, but if it is on sale, then it is a good buy. Have you played the original Crimson Room and its flash game sequels? While those are classic nostalgic games, this game is a different \"feel\", but I would also say that it is a lot better designed and a lot more etiquettely pleasing than the previous games. The ending is somewhat cool but you could ask yourself, what was the point of all that, when finished.... Most importantly, if you can get through this game without a guide it might take hours of your time. Let's be honest, how likely are you to not look at a guide?",
